sting linked compatibility test executes20 representative cases and preserves37 authority definitions, while the full canonical native/global gate retains the complete admitted set. No publication, denied-work retry, policy waiver, cutover or new accounting stream.\n\n# Bounded ER correction for existing M7 public command acceptance\n\nOwner: one ER correction worker; root coordinates and alone writes AEP. Existing approved requirement: M7 whole Connectors adoption must preserve the real public revalidation/restart journey, original30s deadline, durable clocks/fences/receipts and uncertainty semantics. Owning artifact remains story:ess-evolution-er-metadata-adoption; no new product requirement or review unit.\n\nDemonstrated gap: clean actual catalog journey returns OutcomeUnknown when revalidation reaches its unchanged30s deadline; corrected-vector trace shows durable finish at CLI+34.394s. Direct trace shows2–3ms definition parse/registration versus batch execution2.235s remember,4.074s capture,3.279s dispatch,5.215s finish. Existing persistence correctness and focused revalidation passes cannot prove a public operation completes within its own deadline. Receipts in ../host-audit-diagnostic: persist-corrected-stage-trace.log SHA399e3a0ce2f6fb6624fa87feed95cc42404cac10572c63ac8dae8127335cb102 and catalog-persist-stage-trace-test-1.log SHAfb1a9013a3e68a3059886e47e1103c419b159de09ed60c73d12f79d86ccbc80f. These are failed diagnostics, not acceptance.\n\nSource cause checked by root: entity-executor::Executor::batch calls recover_existing then load per distinct subject. Eventlog reader lookup_batch/lookup_record/load each captures and validates the entire tenant. A four-action batch can capture nine times before append. append_inner additionally captures for recovery and heads; committed_outcome verifies a fresh authoritative capture. Existing append guard locks and checks physical binding/batch/record/subject facts. Do not weaken that boundary.\n\nDeliver the smallest